OL,3,GNEWSASixth arrest over death of man at
OL,4,Ahouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof assisting an offender in connection
OL,8,Fwith a man's death earlier this year.
OL,10,FWarwickshire Police said 45-year-old
OL,11,FCarl Stephens died at a house on
OL,12,FChestnut Avenue in Kenilworth on 20
OL,13,FMarch.
OL,15,FThe force said the 46-year-old woman
OL,16,Ffrom the town remained in custody while
OL,17,Finquiries continued.
OL,19,FShe is sixth person to be arrested in
OL,20,Fconnection with the death.
